flowchart TD
  A[uvicorn starts main:app] --> B[lifespan context enters]
  B --> C[backup.manager.ensure_db_or_restore]
  C --> D[database.init_db]
  D --> D1[CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS x26 tables]
  D1 --> D2[Inline ALTER migrations in init_db loop]
  D2 --> D3[Normalize epss_score zeros to NULL]
  D --> E[scheduler.start_scheduler]
  E --> E1[Register 13 APScheduler jobs]
  E1 --> E2[scheduler.start]
  E --> F[scheduler.maybe_run_on_startup]
  F --> F1{CVE count less than 10?}
  F1 -->|yes| F2[asyncio.create_task run_full_ingest_sync]
  F1 -->|no| F3[strip_auto_generated_summaries + enrich_kev_summaries]
  F --> G[maybe_run_mitre_on_startup]
  G --> G1{mitre or atlas count less than 10?}
  G1 -->|yes| G2[create_task run_weekly_mitre_refresh]
  F --> H[create_task run_epss_backfill]
  F --> I[create_task run_exploit_sources_sync if enabled]
  G2 --> J[FastAPI ready — /api endpoints live]
  F2 --> J
  F3 --> J
  G1 -->|no| J
  H --> J
  I --> J
  K[On shutdown] --> K1[scheduler.stop_scheduler]
  K1 --> K2[resilient_client.close_client]
